counterfactuals.output:
1. A receiving apparatus comprising:

a receiver configured to receive a broadcast signal including a broadcast program and tag information synchronized with a scene of the broadcast program;

a processor configured to obtain an application information table associated with the broadcast program, the application information table including information for acquiring an application;

the processor being further configured to acquire the application based on the application information table and to execute the acquired application;

a tag information extractor configured to extract the tag information from the broadcast signal in association with presentation of the scene of the broadcast program;

a related-information acquisition unit configured to retrieve related information corresponding to the scene by using the extracted tag information; and

an application interface configured to supply the retrieved related information to the executing application,

wherein the executing application performs a process using the related information in synchronization with the scene of the broadcast program.

1. An apparatus for processing a broadcast signal, the apparatus comprising:

a receiver configured to receive a broadcast signal including a program and tag data associated with the program;

a demultiplexer configured to extract, from the broadcast signal, the program, the tag data, and an application information table;

a controller configured to identify, based on the application information table, an application associated with the program and to control execution of the identified application;

a scene information processor configured to determine, from the tag data, scene identification information corresponding to a scene of the program being presented; and

a communication interface configured to acquire, based on the scene identification information and under control of the identified application, related information associated with the scene,

wherein the controller is further configured to cause the acquired related information to be output in association with presentation of the scene of the program.
